⸻

FINAL USER FLOW

Create Project

→ name it

→ open it

→ see chats

→ New Chat

→ chat normally with BlueMind

and:

Normal Chat

→ conversation menu

→ Move to Project

→ choose Project

→ conversation now appears inside that Project.

That is the complete Project feature for now.

